&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;新株予約権の行使時の払込金額（円）&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;※&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
